OL,3,AHundreds of North Sea workers too heavy
OL,4,Afor new helicopter rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of North Sea workers are still
OL,7,Ftoo heavy for offshore helicopter
OL,8,Ftravel less than two months before new
OL,9,Frules come into force, BBC Scotland has
OL,10,Flearned.
OL,12,FFrom November they should weigh no more
OL,13,Fthan 124.7kg (19.5st) in their clothing
OL,14,Fand footwear, so they can be winched to
OL,15,Fsafety in an emergency.
OL,17,FWhen the plans were announced by
OL,18,Findustry body Offshore Energies UK
OL,19,F(OEUK) last year, they said more than
OL,20,F2,200 workers were above that limit.
OL,21,FNew figures suggest up to 800 still
OL,22,Fexceed it.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,0,100
