OL,3,AHundreds of North Sea workers too heavy
OL,4,Afor new helicopter rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FJobs could be lost as a result, and an
OL,7,Foccupational health expert said some
OL,8,Fhad left the offshore industry rather
OL,9,Fthan lose the weight.
